{"id":"c53fe47de39217ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-distribution.md","title":"Distribution","display":"df-distribution — Distribution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-distribution","aliases":["58-df-distribution","Distribution","Generalized Function"],"display":"df-distribution — Distribution","depends_on":["[[58-df-test-function]]","[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-distribution</span><span>Distribution</span><span>Generalized Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-distribution — Distribution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"58-df-test-function\">58-df-test-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9c027eec7ccac7b\" href=\"?note=e9c027eec7ccac7b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-closure.md\">../batch18/58-df-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> is open in the Euclidean topology and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(\\Omega)=C_c^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal D(\\Omega)=C_c^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"58-df-test-function\">58-df-test-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\">\\(T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)})\">\\(\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)})\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land\\partial^\\alpha T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land\\partial^\\alpha T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi=\\phi_1+i\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\phi=\\phi_1+i\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial^\\alpha\\phi=D^\\alpha\\phi_1+iD^\\alpha\\phi_2\">\\(\\partial^\\alpha\\phi=D^\\alpha\\phi_1+iD^\\alpha\\phi_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\alpha\">\\(D^\\alpha\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-differential-operator</code> 的实多重导数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)=\\overline{\\{x\\in\\Omega:\\phi(x)\\ne0\\}}^{\\,\\Omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)=\\overline{\\{x\\in\\Omega:\\phi(x)\\ne0\\}}^{\\,\\Omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\Subset\\Omega\">\\(K\\Subset\\Omega\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\Omega\">\\(K\\subseteq\\Omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 在欧氏子空间拓扑中紧；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\beta|=\\sum_{j&lt;n}\\beta(j)\">\\(|\\beta|=\\sum_{j&lt;n}\\beta(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\omega^n\">\\(\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\)</span>。实部与虚部唯一确定，故上述复导数无分解选择。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}complexification} \\vdash \\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}complexification} \\vdash \\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}space} \\vdash T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(T(a\\phi+b\\psi)=aT(\\phi)+bT(\\psi))\\bigr]\\land\\forall K\\Subset\\Omega\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)\\subseteq K\\to|T(\\phi)|\\leq C\\sum_{|\\beta|\\leq m}\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\partial^\\beta\\phi(x)|:x\\in K\\}\\bigr))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}space} \\vdash T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(T(a\\phi+b\\psi)=aT(\\phi)+bT(\\psi))\\bigr]\\land\\forall K\\Subset\\Omega\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)\\subseteq K\\to|T(\\phi)|\\leq C\\sum_{|\\beta|\\leq m}\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\partial^\\beta\\phi(x)|:x\\in K\\}\\bigr))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\langle T,\\phi\\rangle\\coloneqq T(\\phi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\langle T,\\phi\\rangle\\coloneqq T(\\phi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}derivative} \\vdash \\partial^\\alpha T\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\phi,(-1)^{|\\alpha|}T(\\partial^\\alpha\\phi)\\rangle:\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}derivative} \\vdash \\partial^\\alpha T\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\phi,(-1)^{|\\alpha|}T(\\partial^\\alpha\\phi)\\rangle:\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Distribution: continuous linear functional on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_c^\\infty\">\\(C_c^\\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples include Dirac <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> and Heaviside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Tempered: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;\">\\(S&#39;\\)</span> slower growth</li>\n<li>Convolution: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T * \\phi \\in C^\\infty\">\\(T * \\phi \\in C^\\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li>The source atom supplies real-valued test functions.  Their explicit complexification is used here, so complex scalar linearity is no longer imposed on a merely real vector space.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hörmander, The Analysis of Linear Partial Differential Operators</li>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-test-function","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-test-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9c027eec7ccac7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-test-function","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega$ is open in the Euclidean topology and $\\mathcal D(\\Omega)=C_c^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[58-df-test-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D(\\Omega)=C_c^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D'_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land\\partial^\\alpha T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi=\\phi_1+i\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial^\\alpha\\phi=D^\\alpha\\phi_1+iD^\\alpha\\phi_2","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)=\\overline{\\{x\\in\\Omega:\\phi(x)\\ne0\\}}^{\\,\\Omega}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\Subset\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"|\\beta|=\\sum_{j<n}\\beta(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}complexification} \\vdash \\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi_1+i\\phi_2:\\phi_1,\\phi_2\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}space} \\vdash T\\in\\mathcal D'_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)}\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(T(a\\phi+b\\psi)=aT(\\phi)+bT(\\psi))\\bigr]\\land\\forall K\\Subset\\Omega\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\;(\\operatorname{supp}(\\phi)\\subseteq K\\to|T(\\phi)|\\leq C\\sum_{|\\beta|\\leq m}\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\partial^\\beta\\phi(x)|:x\\in K\\}\\bigr))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\langle T,\\phi\\rangle\\coloneqq T(\\phi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}derivative} \\vdash \\partial^\\alpha T\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\phi,(-1)^{|\\alpha|}T(\\partial^\\alpha\\phi)\\rangle:\\phi\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"C_c^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"S'","display":false},{"tex":"T * \\phi \\in C^\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2963,"backlinks":[{"id":"70a18be302d94faf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bc125fa84031840f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"The upstream space is real-valued and is defined only for an open Euclidean domain; both facts are now preserved by the alias. Complex test functions require the explicit complexification in [[58-df-distribution]]."},{"id":"50b67351e20f70ca","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u\\in\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)$ (distribution on $\\Omega$, see [[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]])"},{"id":"d7cd34c8146c8621","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)$ (canonical distribution space, see [[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]])"},{"id":"